<title>POLAND: Elektrim prices share issue at PLN 32.6.</title>
<headline>Elektrim prices share issue at PLN 32.6.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-08-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Polish industrial and trading conglomerate Elektrim SA priced the 19 million new common shares for its convertible bond issue at 32.6 zlotys, the firm said an abbreviated version of its issue prospectus.</p>
<p>Each bond can be converted into 57,209 shares.</p>
<p>Elektrim, which has 66.9 million shares outstanding, closed on Tuesday at 32.3 zlotys.</p>
<p>The bonds in the 550-million-zloty seven-year convertible issue carry an annual coupon of two percent and can be redeemed after 2.5 years at 115.3 percent of their par value calculated in marks.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
